==============================================================================
RayClay public distribution — licence and copyright notices
==============================================================================

This file collects, verbatim, every licence and copyright notice that applies
to the RAYCLAY SOURCE DISTRIBUTION - rayclay.h and the vendored source that
builds with it.

It is deliberately NOT a manifest for the whole repository.  On the examples
branch, assets under examples/ carry their own licence beside them -
examples/assets/fonts/ ships an OFL text next to each typeface, and
examples/assets/icons/ ships its own notice - and those are authoritative for
that content.  Collecting them here as well would put one asset's terms in two
places and let the copies drift.  The main branch carries no examples/
directory, so on main there is nothing those notices govern and this file
covers everything shipped.

rayclay.h is an amalgamated single header whose source comments are stripped.
The components marked "Embedded in rayclay.h" below are compiled into it, and
their notices are carried both here and in the banner at the top of rayclay.h.
The vendored glfw/ and SDL3/ directories ship as separate source, not embedded in
the header.

Nothing below modifies any licence: each section reproduces its component's
notice verbatim.


